WEBVTT

00:00:08.072 --> 00:00:11.554
[electronic burbling]

00:00:12.555 --> 00:00:13.338
What?!

00:00:13.382 --> 00:00:15.950
[stammering]

00:00:15.993 --> 00:00:17.212
Whoa! Whoa!

00:00:17.255 --> 00:00:18.735
No! No, no, no!

00:00:18.779 --> 00:00:19.780
[screams]

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.349
Whoa.

00:00:24.393 --> 00:00:26.090
[reeds vocalizing]

00:00:26.134 --> 00:00:32.923
♪ I fall to pieces

00:00:32.967 --> 00:00:35.186
♪ Pieces♪

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:37.928
♪ How can I be

00:00:37.972 --> 00:00:39.103
[groans]

00:00:39.147 --> 00:00:41.236
♪ Just your friend?

00:00:41.279 --> 00:00:44.718
♪ Just your friend♪

00:00:46.241 --> 00:00:48.852
Something tells me your heart
ain't in this mission, Branch.

00:00:48.896 --> 00:00:50.419
What do you mean?

00:00:50.462 --> 00:00:51.725
-I'm here, aren't I?
-♪ Just your friend...♪

00:00:51.768 --> 00:00:53.683
Yeah, you're on a mission,
all right,

00:00:53.727 --> 00:00:55.859
but your heart
is with Miss Poppy.

00:00:55.903 --> 00:00:57.905
Hey, hold your horses.

00:00:59.341 --> 00:01:00.995
I'm sorry, is that offensive?

00:01:01.038 --> 00:01:02.170
[chuckles]

00:01:02.213 --> 00:01:03.693
Not as offensive
as you thinking

00:01:03.737 --> 00:01:06.130
I can't see what's right
in front of my eyes.

00:01:06.174 --> 00:01:07.305
Did you tell her yet?

00:01:07.349 --> 00:01:09.873
I tried, but...

00:01:09.917 --> 00:01:11.701
[descending whistle,
imitates explosion]

00:01:11.745 --> 00:01:14.051
Well, if you did tell her, who
knows if she'd even hear you?

00:01:14.095 --> 00:01:15.749
What do you mean by that?

00:01:15.792 --> 00:01:19.013
Well, let's just say only one
of you is doing the listening

00:01:19.056 --> 00:01:21.363
in this relationship,
and it's not her.

00:01:21.406 --> 00:01:23.626
♪ Friend.♪

00:01:25.106 --> 00:01:26.150
It's you.

00:01:26.194 --> 00:01:28.413
Yeah. I got that. Thanks.

00:01:28.457 --> 00:01:30.459
Uh, guys?

00:01:30.502 --> 00:01:32.809
[electronic humming
and pulsing]

00:01:32.853 --> 00:01:34.942
-[whimpering]
-What in buttered biscuits?!

00:01:40.121 --> 00:01:42.253
-Huh?
-I got it.

00:01:42.297 --> 00:01:43.777
-Ooh.
-[grunting]

00:01:44.821 --> 00:01:46.431
[shouts]

00:01:46.475 --> 00:01:48.216
[grunts] Oh!

00:01:48.259 --> 00:01:49.783
Oh.

00:01:49.826 --> 00:01:50.827
[gasps]

00:01:50.871 --> 00:01:52.002
[screams]

00:01:52.046 --> 00:01:53.656
Whoo-hey!

00:01:56.354 --> 00:01:59.053
["Atomic Dog" playing]

00:02:00.576 --> 00:02:02.839
♪ Bow-wow-wow,
yippie-yo-yippie-yay ♪

00:02:02.883 --> 00:02:04.754
♪ Bow-wow-wow, yippie-yo-
yippie-yay ♪

00:02:04.798 --> 00:02:07.322
♪ Bow-wow-yip-yippie,
yippie-yo-yippie-yay ♪

00:02:07.365 --> 00:02:09.541
♪ Just walking the dog

00:02:09.585 --> 00:02:12.631
♪ Atomic dog

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:20.161
♪ Just walking the dog.

00:02:20.204 --> 00:02:21.292
Oh.

00:02:21.336 --> 00:02:22.859
-[screams, grunts]
-[whoops]

00:02:22.903 --> 00:02:24.774
PRINCE D:
Welcome to Vibe City.

00:02:24.818 --> 00:02:27.864
You are cordial guests
of Prince Cooper.

00:02:27.908 --> 00:02:28.996
Cooper?!

00:02:29.039 --> 00:02:31.259
-What are you doing here?!
-[laughs]

00:02:31.302 --> 00:02:33.696
Actually, I'm over here.

00:02:34.653 --> 00:02:35.393
What?

00:02:35.437 --> 00:02:37.308
Bacon-wrapped hot dogs!

00:02:37.352 --> 00:02:38.701
Okay. Maybe all the jazz

00:02:38.745 --> 00:02:40.572
-hasn't left my brain yet.
-[notes playing]

00:02:40.616 --> 00:02:43.314
It turns out
I'm actually from Vibe City,

00:02:43.358 --> 00:02:44.794
just like my twin brother.

00:02:44.838 --> 00:02:46.491
I'm Prince D.
What's poppin'?

00:02:46.535 --> 00:02:48.493
[both laughing]

00:02:48.537 --> 00:02:50.452
I got a twin brother.

00:02:50.495 --> 00:02:51.670
How is this possible?

00:02:51.714 --> 00:02:55.326
Well, it's a very
complicated story.

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:56.719
When we were both babies,

00:02:56.763 --> 00:02:58.503
my egg got snatched
out of the nest.

00:02:58.547 --> 00:03:00.549
Mom and Dad looked everywhere,
but they couldn't find me,

00:03:00.592 --> 00:03:02.943
-so you guys raised me as
one of your own.-TROLLS: Aw.

00:03:02.986 --> 00:03:04.422
Now dig this. [laughs]

00:03:04.466 --> 00:03:06.294
COOPER: And then
when I went out to go find

00:03:06.337 --> 00:03:10.733
other Trolls like me, my mom
and dad finally found me.

00:03:10.777 --> 00:03:12.691
QUEEN ESSENCE:
Q, is that him?

00:03:12.735 --> 00:03:14.215
I think our search
is finally over.

00:03:14.258 --> 00:03:16.347
Our son is finally home.

00:03:16.391 --> 00:03:18.393
[gasps]

00:03:18.436 --> 00:03:20.264
I guess it wasn't
too complicated.

00:03:20.308 --> 00:03:21.831
-[both laugh]
-Oh.

00:03:21.875 --> 00:03:25.617
Poppy, I want you to meet
the King and Queen of Funk.

00:03:25.661 --> 00:03:27.924
King Quincy and Queen Essence.

00:03:27.968 --> 00:03:29.447
My mom and dad.

00:03:29.491 --> 00:03:31.536
Aw.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:33.843
Wow, Cooper.
You look just like your dad.

00:03:33.887 --> 00:03:36.977
Yeah, that must be
why he's so good-looking.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:38.369
Was that a dad joke?

00:03:38.413 --> 00:03:39.936
It was lame!

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:41.720
-[laughter]
-Well, so that means

00:03:41.764 --> 00:03:43.331
you're a Funk Troll?

00:03:43.374 --> 00:03:45.028
You don't have to be
just one thing.

00:03:45.072 --> 00:03:46.682
I'm Pop and Funk.

00:03:46.725 --> 00:03:48.858
-Or maybe you're Hip-Hop,
like me. -Yeah.

00:03:48.902 --> 00:03:50.773
Hip-Hop?

00:03:50.817 --> 00:03:52.775
PRINCE D:
Yeah. I think your map

00:03:52.819 --> 00:03:54.646
-is a bit outdated.
-Hmm.

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:57.475
Oh, he's right. Look at that.
It still has Disco.

00:03:57.519 --> 00:03:58.999
POPPY:
Well, Your Majesties,

00:03:59.042 --> 00:04:02.567
we need your help to save
all music from Queen Barb.

00:04:02.611 --> 00:04:04.482
If we combine our music,

00:04:04.526 --> 00:04:05.962
she'll see that music
unites all Trolls

00:04:06.006 --> 00:04:08.704
and that we're all the same
and that she's one of us!

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:13.056
Poppy, I mean no disrespect,

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:16.190
but king to queen,
anything but that.

00:04:16.233 --> 00:04:17.539
Why not?

00:04:17.582 --> 00:04:18.801
